1915	  362|   The kernel is even, positive off zero, locally integrable, decreasing on
1916	  363|   $(0,\infty)$, and $K_\star(u) \le |u|^{-a}$ off zero. Its exact row maximum on
1917	  364|   $[0,1]$ is
